      "remediation": {
        "description": "Lambda function has plaintext secrets in environment variables. Credentials are visible to anyone with lambda:GetFunction permission and appear in CloudTrail configuration change logs.",
        "action": "Move secrets to AWS Secrets Manager or SSM Parameter Store SecureString. Update the function code to retrieve secrets at runtime via the AWS SDK. Remove the plaintext values from the environment variable configuration. Use the Lambda Secrets Manager extension for cached retrieval with minimal latency impact.",
